[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふー、泳いだ泳いだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew, that was a lot of swimming!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、あれだけ泳げれば十分じゃない？\n本番は道具に頼れるわけだし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, if you can swim that much, it should be enough, right? We can rely on tools for the real thing anyway."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ありがとう……でも、本番は負けないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Th-thank you... But I won't lose when it counts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふん、こっちのセリフよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph, that's my line!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ、水上レースに向けて道具を作ろっか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright then, let's make some gear for the water race!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュは泳ぐの得意じゃないなら、\n小型の船を造ったほうがいいのかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since swimming isn't your strong suit, Antje, maybe we should build you a small boat?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね……そうするつもり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... That's what I was planning."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナちゃんはどうする？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What about you, Johanna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はもっと身軽に動けるものがいいわね。\nちょっと考えてるものがあるんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want something that lets me move more freely. I've got something in mind..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、その考えを聞かせてもらえるかな？\n調合は私も手伝うから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then let me hear your idea! I'll help with the synthesis too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ、私は船を造るから……\n王都まで素材の買い出しに行ってくる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll work on building the boat... I'm going to the capital to buy materials."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "手伝うよー！\u3000王都へ、しゅっぱーつ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll help! Off to the capital we go!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……これと、これも用意した。\nあと必要なのは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I got this, and this too. What I still need is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "石札、石札をお持ちではありませんか？\n石札をいただければ、お得なものと交換しますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stone tablets, do you have any stone tablets? If you provide stone tablets, I'll exchange them for something valuable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ワルター……なにしてるのかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther... What are you doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "最近、ずっと広場でああしてるらしいよ。\n変な男がいるって噂になっちゃってるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He's been doing that in the plaza all the time lately. There are rumors going around about some weird guy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ……変な男……まあ、今更よね。最初から変だし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe... Weird guy... Well, that's nothing new. He's always been weird."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、ワルター！\u3000いい加減やめなよそれ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, Walther! Give it a rest already!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おや、アンチュにイザナ。\nご無沙汰しております",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Antje and Izana. It's been a while."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ワルター、変な男だって。ふふ……くく……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther, you're a weird guy. Hehe... Hehehe..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたに笑われるのは心外ですね。\nまあ、いいでしょう。これも仕事ですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being laughed at by you is rather hurtful. Well, no matter. This is work, after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仕事？\u3000そもそも、なんの石札が欲しいの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Work? What kind of stone tablets do you want anyway?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "言うことはできません。今は、まだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I cannot say. Not yet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……もしかして、クリセルダからの指示？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Could this be orders from Criselda?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……さあ。どうでしょう。\nそうだ、クリセルダと言えば",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Who knows? Perhaps. Speaking of Criselda..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュ。あなたにクリセルダから贈りものです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje, this is a gift from Criselda for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これは……武器？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is... a weapon?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レースに役立てろ、とのことですよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She says to use it for the race."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう。ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とにかく、程々にしなよ？\nおかしい人って思われちゃうよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Anyway, tone it down a bit, okay? People are going to think you're crazy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かっていますよ。ご心配ありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand. Thank you for your concern."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ、買い出しの続きに行こっか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's get back to shopping then!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]